      "Mantenim el preu fix, transparent i sense sorpreses. Però quan aconseguim superar el preu que hem pactat junts, pots decidir que una part d'aquest valor extra es converteixi en oportunitats reals per a joves de la província.": "We keep the price fixed, transparent and surprise-free. But when we manage to exceed the price we agreed together, you can decide that part of that extra value becomes real opportunities for young people in the province.",
